/**
 * The floor: a program that does nothing but say so.
 *
 * Starting a process, mapping the binary and putting the standard streams into binary mode costs the same in every
 * program of this suite, and on Windows it is tens of milliseconds. `run.sh` measures it here and subtracts it from
 * every other row, so a ratio is about the work and not about the operating system.
 */
print "nothing 0"
